/T (SonicLink demonstrates a complete acoustic digital communication prototype using Java. The system transforms application data into binary information, represents those bits with two audio frequencies, transmits the resulting waveform, and provides a receiving path that can synchronize, demodulate, decode, and verify the packet.)
/E (SonicLink demonstrates a complete acoustic digital communication prototype using Java. The system transforms application data into binary information, represents those bits with two audio frequencies, transmits the resulting waveform, and provides a receiving path that can synchronize, demodulate, decode, and verify the packet.)
