/Title (SonicLink demonstrates a complete acoustic digital communication prototype using Java. The system transforms application data into binary information, represents those bits with two audio frequencies, transmits the resulting waveform, and provides a receiving path that can synchronize, demodulate, decode, and verify the packet.)
/Dest [27 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 418 0 R
/Next 690 0 R
>>
